s=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Context</span> </code></span></td><td>应用的Context实例。</td></tr><tr><td><code>callback</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@NonNull</span> <wbr><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\"><span class=\"jv-type\">SDKManagerCallback</span></a> </code></span></td><td>返回执行结果的回调。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_isregistered\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_isregistered_inline\">isRegistered</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_isregistered_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>isRegistered</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">isRegistered</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取MSDK注册状态。<code>true</code>表示MSDK已经注册成功。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示MSDK已经注册成功。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_destroy\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_destroy_inline\">destroy</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_destroy_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>destroy</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">destroy</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">释放MSDK对资源的占有，释放后，所有回调接口都不会再收到系统的任何事件更新。注意：<code>init</code>和<code>destroy</code>需要在App中成对出现。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_registerapp\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_registerapp_inline\">registerApp</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_registerapp_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>registerApp</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">registerApp</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">MSDK注册，MSDK通过互联网连接DJI服务器验证开发者在官网申请的App KEY。本方法需要在<code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_oninitprocess\">onInitProcess</a></code>方法中返回<code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_djisdkinitevent_initialize_complete\">INITIALIZE_COMPLETE</a></code>事件后开始调用，无论是注册成功还是注册失败都会在<code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback\">SDKManagerCallback</a></code>中返回，成功注册后MSDK会自动开始连接硬件产品，如果硬件产品连接成功，会回调<code><a href=\"ISDKManager_SDKManagerCallback.html#isdkmanager_sdkmanagercallback_onproductconnect\">onProductConnect</a></code>方法。 <br></font></p><div class=\"ifm-callout\"><font color=\"#666\"><strong>注意</strong><br><br>1. 如果开发者在<code><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_registerapp\">registerApp</a></code>之前使用离线License文件方式开启LDM，将无需联网就可以完成注册操作。 <br>2. 如果使用联网下载License文件的方式开启LDM，则需要在<code><a href=\"../ILDMManager/ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_enableldm\">enableLDM</a></code>传入<code><a href=\"../ILDMManager/ILDMManager.html#ildmmanager_ldmexemptmodule_msdk_init_and_registration\">MSDK_INIT_AND_REGISTRATION</a></code>，才能通过互联网连接DJI服务器验证App KEY，完成注册流程。 <br>3. MSDK注册成功以后，会把注册信息缓存在本地，再次启动MSDK的时候，MSDK会校验本地的缓存信息完成注册流程，无需连接互联网，直到应用重新安装后才需要重新进行联网注册操作来完成注册流程。</font></div><p></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_getsdkversion\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_getsdkversion_inline\">getSDKVersion</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_getsdkversion_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getSDKVersion</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getSDKVersion</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取MSDK的版本号。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span></code></span></td><td>返回MSDK版本号。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_getproductcategory\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_getproductcategory_inline\">getProductCategory</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_getproductcategory_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getProductCategory</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.0.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PackageProductCategory</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getProductCategory</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取MSDK包的类型。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"DJISDKManager.html#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PackageProductCategory</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回MSDK类型。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"isdkmanager_packageproductcategory\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_inline\">PackageProductCategory</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"isdkmanager_packageproductcategory_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" 